OL,3,GNEWSATown's Christmas market to mark
OL,4,A30th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Christmas market, which is said to be
OL,7,Fthe largest of its kind in the UK,
OL,8,Fcelebrates its 30th anniversary on
OL,9,FSunday 13 December.
OL,11,FThe Beverley Festival of Christmas
OL,12,Fattracts visitors from all over the UK.
OL,14,FOrganised by East Riding of Yorkshire
OL,15,FCouncil (ERYC), it will feature a
OL,16,Fparade and more than 120 stalls, which
OL,17,Fwill be spread across the town.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
