OL,3,GNEWSATown's Christmas market to mark
OL,4,A30th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Nick Coultish, cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for culture, leisure and
OL,8,Ftourism, said: "We look forward to
OL,9,Fwelcoming visitors from all over the UK
OL,10,Fand are confident that the event will
OL,11,Fprovide a welcome boost to local
OL,12,Fvisitor economy at such a wonderful
OL,13,Ftime of the year."
